---
import selfie from '../assets/unit-image-capture.png'
import linkedinIcon from '../assets/linkedin.svg'
import githubIcon from '../assets/github.svg'
---
<h2> Unit S815 </h2>

<div class="paragraph-with-image">
    <div>
        <p>Hello, I'm Sam.</p>
        <p>I'm a C# software developer and I have a bit of an interest in video games :)</p>
            These are three of my favorite games:
        <ul>
            <li>
                <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/524220/NieRAutomata/">NieR: Automata</a>
                <a href="#footnote1">*</a>
            </li>
            <li><a href="https://en.bandainamcoent.eu/dark-souls/dark-souls-iii">The Dark Souls Franchise</a></li>
            <li><a href="http://www.furigame.com/">Furi</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <figure>
        <img
            id="selfie-image"
            src={selfie.src}
            alt="A picture of Sam" />
        <figcaption class="image-caption">
            <a href="https://github.com/SamuelSalam815">
                <img
                        class="icon"
                        src={githubIcon.src}
                        alt="github icon"
                />SamuelSalam815
            </a>
            <br>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/samuel-salam-07b050251/">
                <img
                        class="icon"
                        src={linkedinIcon.src}
                        alt="linkedin icon"
                />Samuel Salam
            </a>
        </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <sub id="footnote1">* The design of this page is derived from the user interface of NieR: Automata. See this cool <a
            href="https://www.platinumgames.com/official-blog/article/9624">blog</a>!</sub>
</div>